{
	"title": "Bilinéarité du produit scalaire",
	"description": "Développer un produit scalaire par bilinéarité à partir des normes et du produit scalaire de deux vecteurs",
	"grades": ["1_SPE"],
	"theme": "Géométrie",
	"domain": "Produit scalaire",
	"subdomain": "Propriétés",
	"level": 2,
	"status": "draft",
	"delay": 120,
	"shared": {
		"blankDefaults": {
			"acceptDecimal": true
		}
	},
	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "On donne $\\|\\vec{u}\\|={{a}}$, $\\|\\vec{v}\\|={{b}}$ et $\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}={{p}}$.\n\nCalcule $(\\vec{u}{{bt;+}}\\vec{v})\\cdot({{gm}}\\vec{u}{{dl;+}}\\vec{v})$.\n\n$(\\vec{u}{{bt;+}}\\vec{v})\\cdot({{gm}}\\vec{u}{{dl;+}}\\vec{v})=?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "2..6"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "2..6"
				},
				{
					"name": "p",
					"expression": "{{eval:max(-9,1-a*b)}}..{{eval:min(9,a*b-1)}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "bt",
					"expression": "-3..3"
				},
				{
					"name": "gm",
					"expression": "2..3"
				},
				{
					"name": "dl",
					"expression": "-3..3"
				},
				{
					"name": "c1",
					"expression": "{{eval:dl+bt*gm}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "R",
					"expression": "{{eval:gm*a^2+(dl+bt*gm)*p+bt*dl*b^2}}"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["p != 0", "abs(p) < a*b", "abs(bt) >= 2", "abs(dl) >= 2", "dl + bt*gm != 0"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{R}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"Le produit scalaire est **bilinéaire** : on développe comme un produit de deux sommes.",
					"$(\\vec{u}{{bt;+}}\\vec{v})\\cdot({{gm}}\\vec{u}{{dl;+}}\\vec{v})={{gm}}\\,\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{u}{{dl;+}}\\,\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}{{eval:bt*gm;+}}\\,\\vec{v}\\cdot\\vec{u}{{eval:bt*dl;+}}\\,\\vec{v}\\cdot\\vec{v}$",
					"soit $(\\vec{u}{{bt;+}}\\vec{v})\\cdot({{gm}}\\vec{u}{{dl;+}}\\vec{v})={{gm}}\\|\\vec{u}\\|^2{{eval:dl+bt*gm;+}}\\,\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}{{eval:bt*dl;+}}\\|\\vec{v}\\|^2$",
					"Or $\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{u}=\\|\\vec{u}\\|^2={{eval:a^2}}$, $\\vec{v}\\cdot\\vec{v}=\\|\\vec{v}\\|^2={{eval:b^2}}$ et $\\vec{v}\\cdot\\vec{u}=\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}={{p}}$ (symétrie).",
					"Donc $(\\vec{u}{{bt;+}}\\vec{v})\\cdot({{gm}}\\vec{u}{{dl;+}}\\vec{v})={{gm}}\\times {{eval:a^2}}{{eval:dl+bt*gm;+}}\\times {{p;()}}{{eval:bt*dl;+}}\\times {{eval:b^2}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{ {{R}} }$"
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "On donne $\\|\\vec{u}\\|={{a}}$, $\\|\\vec{v}\\|={{b}}$ et $\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}={{p}}$.\n\nDéveloppe puis calcule $({{al}}\\vec{u}-\\vec{v})\\cdot(\\vec{u}+{{dl}}\\vec{v})$.\n\n$({{al}}\\vec{u}-\\vec{v})\\cdot(\\vec{u}+{{dl}}\\vec{v})=?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "2..6"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "2..6"
				},
				{
					"name": "p",
					"expression": "{{eval:max(-9,1-a*b)}}..{{eval:min(9,a*b-1)}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "al",
					"expression": "2..4"
				},
				{
					"name": "dl",
					"expression": "2..4"
				},
				{
					"name": "R",
					"expression": "{{eval:al*a^2+(al*dl-1)*p-dl*b^2}}"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["p != 0", "abs(p) < a*b"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{R}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"Le produit scalaire est **bilinéaire** : on développe comme un produit de deux sommes.",
					"$({{al}}\\vec{u}-\\vec{v})\\cdot(\\vec{u}+{{dl}}\\vec{v})={{al}}\\,\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{u}+{{eval:al*dl}}\\,\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}-\\vec{v}\\cdot\\vec{u}-{{dl}}\\,\\vec{v}\\cdot\\vec{v}={{al}}\\|\\vec{u}\\|^2+{{eval:al*dl-1}}\\,\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}-{{dl}}\\|\\vec{v}\\|^2$",
					"Or $\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{u}=\\|\\vec{u}\\|^2={{eval:a^2}}$, $\\vec{v}\\cdot\\vec{v}=\\|\\vec{v}\\|^2={{eval:b^2}}$ et $\\vec{v}\\cdot\\vec{u}=\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}={{p}}$ (symétrie).",
					"Donc $({{al}}\\vec{u}-\\vec{v})\\cdot(\\vec{u}+{{dl}}\\vec{v})={{al}}\\times {{eval:a^2}}+{{eval:al*dl-1}}\\times {{p;()}}-{{dl}}\\times {{eval:b^2}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{ {{R}} }$"
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Dans un triangle $ABC$, on sait que $AB={{a}}$, $AC={{b}}$ et $\\overrightarrow{AB}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AC}={{p}}$.\n\nEn décomposant $\\overrightarrow{BC}$ à l'aide de la relation de Chasles, calcule $\\overrightarrow{AB}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{BC}$.\n\n$\\overrightarrow{AB}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{BC}=?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "2..6"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "2..6"
				},
				{
					"name": "p",
					"expression": "{{eval:max(-9,1-a*b)}}..{{eval:min(9,a*b-1)}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "R",
					"expression": "{{eval:p-a^2}}"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["p != 0", "abs(p) < a*b"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{R}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"Relation de Chasles : $\\overrightarrow{BC}=\\overrightarrow{BA}+\\overrightarrow{AC}=-\\overrightarrow{AB}+\\overrightarrow{AC}$.",
					"Par bilinéarité : $\\overrightarrow{AB}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{BC}=\\overrightarrow{AB}\\cdot\\left(-\\overrightarrow{AB}+\\overrightarrow{AC}\\right)=-\\overrightarrow{AB}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AB}+\\overrightarrow{AB}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AC}=-AB^2+\\overrightarrow{AB}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AC}$",
					"Donc $\\overrightarrow{AB}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{BC}=-{{eval:a^2}}+{{p;()}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{ {{R}} }$"
				]
			}
		}
	],
